 279:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\drivers/peripheral/syspm/cy_syspm.h **** *
 280:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\drivers/peripheral/syspm/cy_syspm.h **** * To set regulator normal current mode, call the 
